      "locked": false,
      "text": "Desktop and web: 200% zoom on a 1280\npx window leaves 640 px, so the web uses\nthe phone layout. The desktop app either\ndoes the same or stops zoom at 150%: to\ndecide before M5 builds the layout.",
      "originalText": "Desktop and web: 200% zoom on a 1280\npx window leaves 640 px, so the web uses\nthe phone layout. The desktop app either\ndoes the same or stops zoom at 150%: to\ndecide before M5 builds the layout.",
